{"id": "25", "model": "openai/gpt-5.5", "question": "$A$ ও $B$ বিন্দুর অবস্থান ভেক্টর যথাক্রমে, $2\\hat{i}+3\\hat{j}-4\\hat{k}$ ও $4\\hat{i}-3\\hat{j}+2\\hat{k}$। $\\overrightarrow{AB}$ এর মান এবং $\\overrightarrow{AB}$ বরাবর এক ভেক্টরের মান নির্ণয় কর।", "expected_final_answer": "$|\\overrightarrow{AB}|=\\sqrt{76}$, $\\hat{a}=\\frac{2\\hat{i}-6\\hat{j}+6\\hat{k}}{\\sqrt{76}}$", "predicted_answer": "DetailedAnswer:\n\\[\n\\vec{OA}=2\\hat{i}+3\\hat{j}-4\\hat{k}\n\\]\n\\[\n\\vec{OB}=4\\hat{i}-3\\hat{j}+2\\hat{k}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\overrightarrow{AB}=\\vec{OB}-\\vec{OA}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n=(4\\hat{i}-3\\hat{j}+2\\hat{k})-(2\\hat{i}+3\\hat{j}-4\\hat{k})\n\\]\n\n\\[\n=(4-2)\\hat{i}+(-3-3)\\hat{j}+\\{2-(-4)\\}\\hat{k}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\overrightarrow{AB}=2\\hat{i}-6\\hat{j}+6\\hat{k}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n|\\overrightarrow{AB}|=\\sqrt{2^2+(-6)^2+6^2}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n=\\sqrt{4+36+36}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n=\\sqrt{76}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n=2\\sqrt{19}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\overrightarrow{AB}\\text{ বরাবর একক ভেক্টর}\n=\\frac{\\overrightarrow{AB}}{|\\overrightarrow{AB}|}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n=\\frac{2\\hat{i}-6\\hat{j}+6\\hat{k}}{2\\sqrt{19}}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n=\\frac{\\hat{i}-3\\hat{j}+3\\hat{k}}{\\sqrt{19}}\n\\]\n\nFinalAnswer:\n\\[\n|\\overrightarrow{AB}|=2\\sqrt{19}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\overrightarrow{AB}\\text{ বরাবর একক ভেক্টর}\n=\\frac{\\hat{i}-3\\hat{j}+3\\hat{k}}{\\sqrt{19}}\n\\]", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 203, "completion_tokens": 689, "total_tokens": 892, "cost": 0.021685, "is_byok": false, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0, "cache_write_tokens": 0, "audio_tokens": 0, "video_tokens": 0}, "cost_details": {"upstream_inference_cost": 0.021685, "upstream_inference_prompt_cost": 0.001015, "upstream_inference_completions_cost": 0.02067}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 297, "image_tokens": 0, "audio_tokens": 0}}}
{"id": "29", "model": "openai/gpt-5.5", "question": "যদি $\\bar{a}=\\hat{i}+\\hat{j}+\\hat{k},\\ \\bar{b}=\\sqrt{3}\\hat{i}+3\\hat{j}-2\\hat{k}$ হয় তাহলে $\\bar{b}$ ভেক্টরের উপর $\\bar{a}$ ভেক্টরের অভিক্ষেপ বের কর।", "expected_final_answer": "$\\frac{\\sqrt{3}+1}{4}$", "predicted_answer": "DetailedAnswer:\n\\[\n\\bar{a}=\\hat{i}+\\hat{j}+\\hat{k},\\quad \\bar{b}=\\sqrt{3}\\hat{i}+3\\hat{j}-2\\hat{k}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\bar{a}\\cdot \\bar{b}=1\\cdot \\sqrt{3}+1\\cdot 3+1\\cdot (-2)\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\bar{a}\\cdot \\bar{b}=\\sqrt{3}+3-2=\\sqrt{3}+1\n\\]\n\n\\[\n|\\bar{b}|=\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{3})^2+3^2+(-2)^2}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n|\\bar{b}|=\\sqrt{3+9+4}=\\sqrt{16}=4\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\text{Projection of } \\bar{a} \\text{ on } \\bar{b}\n=\\frac{\\bar{a}\\cdot \\bar{b}}{|\\bar{b}|}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}+1}{4}\n\\]\n\nFinalAnswer:\n\\[\n\\frac{\\sqrt{3}+1}{4}\n\\]", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 189, "completion_tokens": 776, "total_tokens": 965, "cost": 0.024225, "is_byok": false, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0, "cache_write_tokens": 0, "audio_tokens": 0, "video_tokens": 0}, "cost_details": {"upstream_inference_cost": 0.024225, "upstream_inference_prompt_cost": 0.000945, "upstream_inference_completions_cost": 0.02328}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 516, "image_tokens": 0, "audio_tokens": 0}}}
{"id": "32", "model": "openai/gpt-5.5", "question": "যদি $\\underline{a}=\\hat{i}+2\\hat{j}+3\\hat{k}$ এবং $\\underline{b}=3\\hat{i}-2\\hat{j}+3\\hat{k}$ হয় তবে $a\\times b$ এর মান নির্ণয় কর।", "expected_final_answer": "$2\\sqrt{61}$", "predicted_answer": "DetailedAnswer:\n\\[\n\\underline{a}=\\hat{i}+2\\hat{j}+3\\hat{k}\n\\]\n\\[\n\\underline{b}=3\\hat{i}-2\\hat{j}+3\\hat{k}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\underline{a}\\times \\underline{b}\n=\n\\begin{vmatrix}\n\\hat{i} & \\hat{j} & \\hat{k}\\\\\n1 & 2 & 3\\\\\n3 & -2 & 3\n\\end{vmatrix}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n= \\hat{i}(2\\cdot 3-3\\cdot(-2))-\\hat{j}(1\\cdot 3-3\\cdot 3)+\\hat{k}(1\\cdot(-2)-2\\cdot 3)\n\\]\n\n\\[\n= \\hat{i}(6+6)-\\hat{j}(3-9)+\\hat{k}(-2-6)\n\\]\n\n\\[\n= 12\\hat{i}+6\\hat{j}-8\\hat{k}\n\\]\n\nFinalAnswer:\n\\[\n12\\hat{i}+6\\hat{j}-8\\hat{k}\n\\]", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 176, "completion_tokens": 372, "total_tokens": 548, "cost": 0.01204, "is_byok": false, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0, "cache_write_tokens": 0, "audio_tokens": 0, "video_tokens": 0}, "cost_details": {"upstream_inference_cost": 0.01204, "upstream_inference_prompt_cost": 0.00088, "upstream_inference_completions_cost": 0.01116}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 117, "image_tokens": 0, "audio_tokens": 0}}}
{"id": "37", "model": "openai/gpt-5.5", "question": "$A(1,2)$ শীর্ষবিশিষ্ট বর্গের একটি কর্ণ $3x-4y-6=0$ হলে, $A$ বিন্দুগামী বাহুদ্বয়ের সমীকরণ নির্ণয় কর।", "expected_final_answer": "$(y-2)=7(x-1)$ এবং $(y-2)=-\\frac{1}{7}(x-1)$", "predicted_answer": "DetailedAnswer:\n\\[\nA(1,2),\\quad \\text{প্রদত্ত কর্ণ: }3x-4y-6=0\n\\]\n\n\\[\n3(1)-4(2)-6=-11\\ne 0\n\\]\n\nঅতএব প্রদত্ত কর্ণটি \\(A\\) বিন্দুগামী কর্ণ নয়।\n\nপ্রদত্ত কর্ণের ঢাল:\n\\[\n3x-4y-6=0\n\\]\n\\[\ny=\\frac34x-\\frac32\n\\]\n\\[\nm=\\frac34\n\\]\n\nঅতএব \\(A\\) বিন্দুগামী অপর কর্ণের ঢাল:\n\\[\nm_d=-\\frac43\n\\]\n\nবর্গের বাহুদ্বয় কর্ণের সঙ্গে \\(45^\\circ\\) কোণ করে। তাই বাহুদ্বয়ের ঢাল হবে:\n\\[\nm_1=\\frac{m_d+1}{1-m_d}\n\\]\n\\[\nm_1=\\frac{-\\frac43+1}{1+\\frac43}\n=\\frac{-\\frac13}{\\frac73}\n=-\\frac17\n\\]\n\nএবং\n\\[\nm_2=\\frac{m_d-1}{1+m_d}\n\\]\n\\[\nm_2=\\frac{-\\frac43-1}{1-\\frac43}\n=\\frac{-\\frac73}{-\\frac13}\n=7\n\\]\n\nঅতএব \\(A(1,2)\\) বিন্দুগামী বাহুদ্বয়ের সমীকরণ:\n\nপ্রথম বাহু:\n\\[\ny-2=-\\frac17(x-1)\n\\]\n\\[\n7y-14=-x+1\n\\]\n\\[\nx+7y-15=0\n\\]\n\nদ্বিতীয় বাহু:\n\\[\ny-2=7(x-1)\n\\]\n\\[\ny-2=7x-7\n\\]\n\\[\n7x-y-5=0\n\\]\n\nFinalAnswer:\n\\[\n\\boxed{x+7y-15=0,\\quad 7x-y-5=0}\n\\]", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 168, "completion_tokens": 1479, "total_tokens": 1647, "cost": 0.04521, "is_byok": false, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0, "cache_write_tokens": 0, "audio_tokens": 0, "video_tokens": 0}, "cost_details": {"upstream_inference_cost": 0.04521, "upstream_inference_prompt_cost": 0.00084, "upstream_inference_completions_cost": 0.04437}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1034, "image_tokens": 0, "audio_tokens": 0}}}
